I worked at Microsoft.

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:43,830
I did not work at Microsoft for negative sentence.

12
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:47,880
We introduce did, did not.

13
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:54,540
And a question starting with auxiliary did did I work at Microsoft?

14
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:59,100
And another example, she studied French.

15
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:02,260
She did not study French.

16
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:05,440
And did she study French?

17
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,430
Okay.

18
00:01:06,790 --> 00:01:13,000
Take a look at this sentences one more time because.

