23
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:28,910
And we're going to check in a moment.

24
00:01:32,390 --> 00:01:32,960
Okay.

25
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:36,830
So I worked at Microsoft.

26
00:01:37,670 --> 00:01:43,100
I didn't or I did not work at Microsoft.

27
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:46,910
